  "transformPolicy": "Trim shared regions sample-accurately, remove DC offset, preserve headroom, and encode Ogg Vorbis without peak normalization.",
  "transformations": {
    "adaptive-stems": "Track 02 full-song stems; shared samples 0-2,880,000 (0-60 s at 48 kHz); bed=pad01, tension=synth+rythm at 0.65, action=percussion+kick+clap+shaker at 0.45, danger=lead+synth02 at 0.6; 25-30 Hz high-pass; 30 ms boundary fades; native Vorbis quality 10.",
    "menu-intro": "Original Foozle track 1.ogg and track 2.ogg retained without re-encoding; Track 02 full mix also trimmed to the shared 60 s region as the combat fallback.",
    "cannon-launch-explosions": "Residue boom, zipper, ventilator, and spit files filtered and resampled into role-specific pitch variants; gains remain 0.68-0.85; native Vorbis quality 6-7.",
    "impacts-ui": "Selected Kenney metal/plate impacts and interface cues converted to stereo Vorbis quality 6; player-damage and game-over cues receive conservative low-pass or pitch treatment.",
    "water-sonar-ambience": "Water re-entry and sonar sources high-pass filtered; propeller and Wind.ogg filtered and attenuated for continuous background playback; stereo Vorbis quality 7."
